<!--
  P3-06: AndroidManifest for the `:feature:pos` library module.

  Library modules don't declare an `<application>` element — the
  consuming `:app` module merges its own manifest with this one at
  build time. This file is intentionally empty (no permissions,
  no activities) because the POS surface is a Compose destination
  reached through the existing nav graph in `:app`.
-->
